-to-cad</a></h1><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-2"><div class="flex items-center"><button class="flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-md transition-colors duration-200 bg-tools-bg text-tools-muted hover:bg-tools-border " aria-label="Upvote"><img alt="Upvote" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/up-arrow-blank.svg"/><span class="font-medium">0</span></button></div><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-tools-accent-light px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-tools-accent">Developer Tools</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-tools-bg px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-tools-muted border border-tools-border">Free</span></div><p class="text-sm text-tools-muted mt-2 line-clamp-2 max-w-2xl">text-to-cad turns agent prompts into CAD model files</p><p class="text-xs text-tools-subtle mt-2">Listing updated<!-- --> <!-- -->Oct 6, 2026</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:items-end w-full sm:w-auto flex-shrink-0"><a href="https://github.com/earthtojake/text-to-cad?utm_source=opentools_web&amp;utm_medium=opentools_medium" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block text-center bg-tools-accent text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-tools-accent-hover transition duration-150 font-semibold text-sm w-full sm:w-auto focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-tools-accent ph-no-capture">Get This Tool</a><div style="display:flex;align-items:center"><div style="width:260px;height:50px"></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;margin-left:-20px"><button style="display:flex;align-items:center;padding:5px 10px;background-color:#f43f5e;color:white;border:none;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer"><span>Copy Code</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="margin-left:5px"><path d="M16 1H4C2.9 1 2 1.9 2 3V17H4V3H16V1ZM20 5H8C6.9 5 6 5.9 6 7V21C6 22.1 6.9 23 8 23H20C21.1 23 22 22.1 22 21V7C22 5.9 21.1 5 20 5ZM20 21H8V7H20V21Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><span style="margin-top:5px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.875rem;color:black">Claim Tool</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><nav class="sticky top-[97px] z-40 bg-white border-b border-tools-border transition-shadow duration-150 "><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex gap-1 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide py-2"><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 bg-tools-accent text-white">Overview</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">Pricing</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">Reviews</button><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-100 text-tools-muted hover:text-tools-text hover:bg-tools-bg">FAQ</button></div></div></nav><section id="overview" class="py-12 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mb-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-tools-text mb-4">What is <!-- -->text-to-cad<!-- -->?</h2><div class="relative max-w-4xl"><p class="text-tools-muted leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line" style="max-height:16rem;overflow:hidden">text-to-cad is an open-source CAD plugin for AI coding agents. It gives Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other compatible assistants a practical way to create CAD artifacts from natural-language instructions. The project README says it can generate STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF files, run design-for-manufacturing checks, create engineering drawings, and connect work to 3D printing, sheet metal, and CNC fabrication services.

The setup paths are concrete. Claude Code users can add the earthtojake marketplace and install the plugin. Codex users can add the same marketplace after upgrading to a recent Codex release. Claude Desktop users can run the cadgen MCP server through uvx, which gives the assistant a local CAD process and viewer flow. The repository also documents Cursor and other clients, so teams can use the tool in the editor or terminal agent they already use instead of moving the whole task to a separate CAD environment.

The value is speed during early hardware and product exploration. A builder can describe a bracket, enclosure, fixture, adapter, or visual mockup, then inspect the generated model before asking the agent for another pass. That does not replace mechanical engineering review, tolerance checks, material selection, regulatory review, or safety validation. It does make the first sketch and handoff faster, especially for software-heavy teams that already live in AI-assisted development workflows.

text-to-cad is strongest when the problem can be described clearly in words and the expected output is a prototype, example, or starting geometry file. It is weaker when the work depends on precise manufacturing tolerances that have not been specified. The README also notes that CAD runtime components may download on first launch, so setup needs a working network connection.

Pricing is simple: the project is MIT licensed and open source. Users still need their chosen agent, uv or uvx, and any paid model or fabrication services they decide to connect. For OpenTools readers, the important point is that text-to-cad turns agent chat into inspectable CAD files instead of leaving hardware ideas as loose text. It is a focused bridge between coding-agent workflows and physical-product prototyping, with enough documented setup detail to test quickly. The current repository also shows active attention to agent-specific installation notes, which matters because CAD generation only becomes useful when the surrounding assistant can install, call, view, and revise the generated artifacts without a brittle manual handoff during early design reviews.</p></div></div><div class="mb-10"><div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-tools-text mb-2">text-to-cad<!-- -->&#x27;s Top Features</h2><p class="text-tools-muted mb-8">Key capabilities that make <!-- -->text-to-cad<!-- --> stand out.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Generates STEP, GLB, STL, and 3MF model files</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Supports Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini, Grok, OpenCode, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code, and other clients</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Runs CAD workflows locally through cadgen and uv or uvx</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Includes design-for-manufacturing checks and engineering drawing generation</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-shadow flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.25 12c0-5.385 4.365-9.75 9.75-9.75s9.75 4.365 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75 9.75S2.25 17.385 2.25 12Zm13.36-1.814a.75.75 0 1 0-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 0 0 1.14-.094l3.75-5.25Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Shows generated models through viewer cards or browser links where supported</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-10"><div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-tools-text mb-2">Use Cases</h2><p class="text-tools-muted mb-8">Who benefits most from this tool.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-colors"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-accent mb-2"><a class="hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/builders-prototyping-physical-products">Builders prototyping physical products</a></h3><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Generate quick printable models, housings, brackets, fixtures, or mockups from an AI agent conversation.</p></div><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-tools-border rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-tools-border-hover transition-colors"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-tools-accent mb-2"><a class="hover:text-tools-accent-hover transition-colors" href="/use-cases/coding-agent-power-users">Coding-agent power users</a></h3><p class="text-tools-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Add a CAD workflow to Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, and similar clients without switching tools.</p></div><div class="bg-tools-surface border border-to